<title>USA: Reliance Acceptance names James Dolph CFO.</title>
<headline>Reliance Acceptance names James Dolph CFO.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO, Texas 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reliance Acceptance Group Inc said it named James Dolph as its chief financial officer to replace Michael Bernick.</p>
<p>Bernick will assume new responsibilities at the company's San Antonio headquarters, according to the company. Officials at the company were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
<p>Dolph was most recently chief financial officer of Sunstar Acceptance Corp, the subprime automobile finance unit of NationsBank, Reliance said.</p>
